---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Article from '../components/Article.astro';

const pageTitle = "Disclaimer - GST Calculator Online";
const pageDesc = "Read the legal and financial disclaimer for gstcalculatoronline.in. Explains calculator accuracies, non-affiliation with the Indian government, and professional consultation advice.";
---
<Layout seo={{ title: pageTitle, description: pageDesc }}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <Breadcrumbs />

    <Article title="Disclaimer">
      <p>If you require any more information or have any questions about our site's disclaimer, please feel free to contact us by email at <a href="mailto:support@gstcalculatoronline.in" class="text-link hover:underline">support@gstcalculatoronline.in</a>.</p>

      <h2>Non-Affiliation with Government of India</h2>
      <p><strong>GST Calculator Online</strong> (gstcalculatoronline.in) is an independent private educational website. We are **NOT affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected** with the Goods and Services Tax Network (GSTN), the Central Board of Indirect Taxes and Customs (CBIC), the Ministry of Finance, or the Government of India.</p>
      <p>The official government portal for managing Goods and Services Tax in India is located at <a href="https://www.gst.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline">www.gst.gov.in</a>.</p>

      <h2>Calculator Accuracy & Financial Advice</h2>
      <p>All calculators, mathematical tools, articles, and guides provided on this website are designed for illustrative and educational purposes only. The tax, late fee, and interest calculations are based on standard mathematical formulas derived from the CGST/SGST Acts and public announcements. However:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not guarantee that the results generated by our calculators are 100% correct, absolute, or free from error.</li>
        <li>GST laws, late fee caps, and penalty rates are subject to frequent amendments and updates by the GST Council. The math implemented in our code may, at times, experience latency during updates.</li>
        <li>The output numbers should not be used as the sole basis for filing taxes, making payments, or executing official contracts.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Never substitute digital calculations for professional tax advise.</strong> We strongly recommend verifying all figures with a qualified Chartered Accountant (CA) or certified tax practitioner before carrying out official filings or financial transactions.</p>

      <h2>Consent & Changes</h2>
      <p>By using our website, you hereby consent to our disclaimer and agree to its terms.</p>
      <p>Should we update, amend or make any changes to this document, those changes will be prominently posted here.</p>
    </Article>
  </div>
</Layout>
